1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,138
The pattern is called criss cross inheritance.

2
00:00:03,138 --> 00:00:10,195
An affected father passes the allele to all his daughters, who become carriers, and to none of his sons.

3
00:00:10,195 --> 00:00:14,335
A carrier mother passes it to half her sons, who are affected.

